  "spokenLines": [
    "An arithmetic sequence adds the same number every time.",
    "Take: three, seven, eleven, fifteen.",
    "The common difference d is four — each term jumps by four.",
    "The first term, a one, is three.",
    "The nth term formula: a n equals a one, plus n minus one, times d.",
    "What's the tenth term?",
    "Plug in: three plus, ten minus one, times four.",
    "That's three plus nine times four.",
    "Three plus thirty six is thirty nine.",
    "So the tenth term is thirty nine."
